%% Incident diagnosis decision tree (Task 4). Raising ECS max is CONDITIONAL.
flowchart TD
    ALERT["Alert 02:47\npayments-processor 10/10, p99 > 4s"] --> IMPACT{"Customer/business impact?\n(payment success rate, 5xx, timeouts)"}
    IMPACT -->|No payment failures| SEV2["Treat as SEV-2\nmonitor, keep diagnosing"]
    IMPACT -->|Payments failing / SLO breach| SEV1["Escalate toward SEV-1"]

    SEV2 --> ECS
    SEV1 --> ECS
    ECS{"ECS evidence\nCPU/mem vs target?\nplacement failures?"}
    ECS -->|running < desired, placement failure| PLACE["PLACEMENT_BLOCKED\nfix IPs/quota/capacity provider"]
    ECS -->|CPU/mem high at max| DOWNSTREAM{"Downstream headroom?\nAurora + external OK?"}
    ECS -->|CPU/mem low at max| EXTERNAL

    DOWNSTREAM -->|Yes, headroom confirmed| RAISE["CONDITIONAL: raise max incrementally\n(e.g. 10 -> 15), preserve min/policies"]
    DOWNSTREAM -->|No - Aurora saturated| DB
    DOWNSTREAM -->|No - external degraded| EXTERNAL

    DB{"Aurora: DBLoad/connections/locks?"}
    DB -->|CPU/DBLoad high| DBCPU["Reduce concurrency\nDO NOT add ECS tasks"]
    DB -->|locks/blocking| DBLOCK["Resolve blocker (impact-aware)"]
    DB -->|connections near limit| DBCONN["Connection budget / pool limits"]

    EXTERNAL{"External provider: timeouts?\nlocal vs external span (traces)"}
    EXTERNAL -->|external span dominates| EXTMIT["Backoff+jitter, circuit breaker\npreserve idempotency, reconcile"]
    EXTERNAL -->|spans normal| DEPLOY

    DEPLOY{"Recent deploy correlates?"}
    DEPLOY -->|Yes, rollback safe| ROLLBACK["Rollback to healthy task def"]
    DEPLOY -->|Irreversible migration| HOLD["Do NOT rollback blindly\nfix-forward"]
    DEPLOY -->|No| TRAFFIC{"Traffic spike / abuse?"}
    TRAFFIC -->|Yes| ADMIT["Admission control / WAF\nprotect payment flows"]
    TRAFFIC -->|No| REASSESS["Reassess telemetry freshness (UNKNOWN)"]

    RAISE --> VERIFY
    PLACE --> VERIFY
    DBCPU --> VERIFY
    DBLOCK --> VERIFY
    DBCONN --> VERIFY
    EXTMIT --> VERIFY
    ROLLBACK --> VERIFY
    ADMIT --> VERIFY
    VERIFY["Verify recovery criteria\n(p99 SLO, payment success,\ntxn reconciliation)"]
